        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8058C, Cortina Lever with #8 Arched Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCortina Lever with Arched Rose is made out of solid brass. The classic shape is not only beautiful but it is also incredibly functional. The shape makes it comfortable to grasp and also easy to clean. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. The Drop Tail Leverset will fit 1-1/4 inch to 4 inch thick doors and has an is available in either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Cortina Lever with #8 Arched Rose is available in a wide array of finishes, so you'll be certain to find the perfect fit for your home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Cortina Drop Tail Lever with Arched Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Cortina Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
